<h1>The 123ofnet.com Webring</h1>
<p>Remember webrings? You put a little bar at the bottom of your site, and visitors could hop
to the next site in the ring. They were a great way to find small, personal sites.</p>
<p>The 123ofnet.com ring is for <b>human-made personal sites</b>. Member sites also get listed in
<a href="/directory/">the Directory</a>.</p>
